  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 06239ebaf86bf2c45958f1720d47e23f, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  tutorialPanel: {fileID: 1531904171}
  tutorialText: {fileID: 314810960}
  message: 'HOW TO PLAY



    WASD - move

    Mouse - look around

    Left Click
    - pick up / drop

    Right Click - spray water

    T - scoreboard

    Esc
    - quit the game

    Tab - settings menu



    Put out the fires and keep the
    buildings safe!

    There are hoses for every player inside the fire station.
    Your job is to grab one and put out all the fires around town. Once a fire start
    above buildings there will be a green indicator.'
  closeKey: 113
